Doi (identifier)\">doi</a>:<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1212%2FNXI.0000000000200025\">10.1212/NXI.0000000000200025</a>. <a href=\"/wiki/ISSN_(identifier)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"ISSN (identifier)\">ISSN</a>&#160;<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://search.worldcat.org/issn/2332-7812\">2332-7812</a>. <a href=\"/wiki/PMC_(identifier)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"PMC (identifier)\">PMC</a>&#160;<span class=\"id-lock-free\" title=\"Freely accessible\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC9427000\">9427000</a></span>. <a href=\"/wiki/PMID_(identifier)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"PMID (identifier)\">PMID</a>&#160;<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/36041861\">36041861</a>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=Neurology+Neuroimmunology+%26+Neuroinflammation&amp;rft.atitle=Toward+Precision+Phenotyping+of+Multiple+Sclerosis&amp;rft.volume=9&amp;rft.issue=6&amp;rft.artnum=e200025&amp;rft.date=2022&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov%2Fpmc%2Farticles%2FPMC9427000%23id-name%3DPMC&amp;rft.issn=2332-7812&amp;rft&#95;id=info%3Apmid%2F36041861&amp;rft&#95;id=info%3Adoi%2F10.1212%2FNXI.0000000000200025&amp;rft.aulast=Pitt&amp;rft.aufirst=David&amp;rft.au=Lo%2C+Chih+Hung&amp;rft.au=Gauthier%2C+Susan+A.&amp;rft.au=Hickman%2C+Richard+A.&amp;rft.au=Longbrake%2C+Erin&amp;rft.au=Airas%2C+Laura+M.&amp;rft.au=Mao-Draayer%2C+Yang&amp;rft.au=Riley%2C+Claire&amp;rft.au=De+Jager%2C+Philip+Lawrence&amp;rft.au=Wesley%2C+Sarah&amp;rft.au=Boster%2C+Aaron&amp;rft.au=Topalli%2C+Ilir&amp;rft.au=Bagnato%2C+Francesca&amp;rft.au=Mansoor%2C+Mohammad&amp;rft.au=Stuve%2C+Olaf&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov%2Fpmc%2Farticles%2FPMC9427000&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AMultiple+sclerosis\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-ninds-3\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-ninds_3-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-ninds_3-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-ninds_3-2\"><sup><i><b>c</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-ninds_3-3\"><sup><i><b>d</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-ninds_3-4\"><sup><i><b>e</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> <span class=\"error mw-ext-cite-error\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">Cite error: The named reference <code>ninds</code> was invoked but never defined (see the <a href=\"/wiki/Help:Cite_errors/Cite_error_references_no_text\" title=\"Help:Cite errors/Cite error references no text\">help page</a>).</span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-4\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-4\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite class=\"citation web cs1\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.nationalmssociety.org/understanding-ms/what-is-ms/clinically-isolated-syndrome-cis\">\"Clinically Isolated Syndrome (CIS)\"</a>. <i>National Multiple Sclerosis Society</i><span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">10 September</span> 2026</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=National+Multiple+Sclerosis+Society&amp;rft.atitle=Clinically+Isolated+Syndrome+%28CIS%29&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.nationalmssociety.org%2Funderstanding-ms%2Fwhat-is-ms%2Fclinically-isolated-syndrome-cis&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AMultiple+sclerosis\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-:1-5\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-:1_5-0\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> <span cl